    "body": "Adds one temporary, owner-authenticated, read-only workflow to reconstruct the already accepted `Safari2234` production session.\n\nScope:\n- GET only `/v1/admin/sessions` and `/v1/admin/export`\n- isolate exactly one `Safari2234` session\n- sort by `occurred_at`, `sequence`, `monotonic_ms`, then event ID\n- emit only a privacy-safe behavioral projection; no raw unrelated records\n- no production mutation, D1 writes, deploy, Pages, runtime, or memory changes\n\nValidation:\n- clean baseline `main@0c922d73d37351b9bd5be0a0f4b298097abba40f`\n- `git diff --check`\n- static endpoint/scope assertions\n\nThis workflow is intended for one readback and will be removed through a follow-up reviewed PR after the report is captured.",
    "changed_files": 1,
